// Bun Snapshot v1, https://bun.sh/docs/test/snapshots

exports[`what the plan costs, in the note is a line per stack with an estimate or a limit: the figures, labelled as an estimate, and what the limit makes of them 1`] = `
"**orch plan**

Commit \`a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0\`

| Stack | Status | Add | Change | Destroy | Plan |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| \`a-pass\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |
| \`b-warn\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |
| \`c-deny\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |
| \`d-unavailable\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |
| \`e-saving\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |

Cost (estimate):

- \`a-pass\`: +42.00 USD a month, total 1234.50 USD (estimate by \`infracost\`); limit 100.00 USD: pass
- \`b-warn\`: +85.00 USD a month, total 1234.50 USD (estimate by \`infracost\`); limit 100.00 USD: warn (\`cost-near-limit\`)
- \`c-deny\`: +250.50 USD a month, total 1234.50 USD (estimate by \`infracost\`); limit 100.00 USD: deny (\`cost-over-limit\`)
- \`d-unavailable\`: no estimate; limit 100.00 USD: deny (\`cost-unavailable\`)
- \`e-saving\`: -10.25 USD a month, total 1234.50 USD (estimate by \`infracost\`); limit 100.00 USD: pass

<sub>Counts only: the plan itself stays in the job. This note is updated, not added to.</sub>"
`;

exports[`what the lint of a zone's config says, in the note (DNS-11) a zone with a lint error is denied in the policy section, by rule and zone, and the note has counts only 1`] = `
"**orch plan**

Commit \`a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0\`

| Stack | Status | Add | Change | Destroy | Plan |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| \`zone\` | planned | 1 | 0 | 0 | – |
| \`net\` | planned | 2 | 0 | 0 | – |

Policy:

- \`zone\`: deny (\`dns-lint-spf-single:example.com\`, \`dns-lint-ttl-range:example.com\`)

DNS lint:

- \`zone\`: 1 error, 1 warning

<sub>Counts only: the plan itself stays in the job. This note is updated, not added to.</sub>"
`;
